Ctrl+B启用。\n\n该工作流旨在帮助AIGC新手学习最基础的AI生成逻辑，通过实操理解AIGC工作流中最基础也是最根本的模块化思维，方便后续学习更加复杂的工作流搭建。\n\n使用流程：（选择文生图或图生图模式）👉（选择大模型）👉（选择【或不选择】lora模型）👉（填写正反提示词）👉选择要启用的controlnet节点👉调整K采样器参数👉生成\n\n注意：SD1.5与SDXL的架构有所区别，所以在生成图像时，lora，controlnet模型都必须选择和当前大模型相匹配的模型，1.5的就用1.5的Lora和controlnet，XL的就用XL的Lora和controlnet。\n同时SDXL和SDXL Illustrious模型架构相同，只是微调方式有所区别，所以这两者的lora和controlnet模型理论上是可以互通的，但建议还是建议用相匹配的模型。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [714.4022216796875, 198.3526153564453], "pos": [-377.9548645019531, 405.3364562988281], "id": 113, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 13}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.25.11", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "groupNodes": {}, "node_versions": {"comfyui_controlnet_aux": "1.0.7", "rgthree-comfy": "1.0.0", "comfy-core": "0.3.32", "comfyui_ipadapter_plus": "2.0.0"}, "ds": {"offset": [1073.329309217665, 460.4072360229491], "scale": 0.33809166040571}}, "groups": [{"color": "#8AA", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "controlnet模块", "bounding": [920, -280, 1095.3040771484375, 1470.5379638671875]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 6, "title": "输入组", "bounding": [-377.73223876953125, 623.0429077148438, 1253.13134765625, 1106.2625732421875]}, {"color": "#A88", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "图生图与文生图Lantent切换", "bounding": [0, 1150, 319.73944091796875, 561.8442993164062]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 5, "title": "Group", "bounding": [-170, 1450, 140, 80]}, {"color": "#88A", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 7, "title": "采样", "bounding": [2050, 630, 389.7369384765625, 561.228271484375]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 8, "title": "控制图上传区", "bounding": [943.073974609375, -226.9540252685547, 1036.350341796875, 288.6614990234375]}, {"color": "#